    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_15",
      "hash64": "F0558E89AF8221FC",
      "text": "I’ve read about it in books before...\\c\\nA mental scar. Like psychological trauma,\\nyou know? I think that’s what you call it.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
